cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "IWAC SEO: an Omeka S module for search-engine optimisation, citation metadata and XML sitemaps"
abstract: >-
  IWAC SEO supplies the search-engine optimisation, citation and sitemap layer
  for the Islam West Africa Collection (IWAC), a bilingual Omeka S digital
  archive of Islam in West Africa. It injects per-page meta descriptions, Open
  Graph and Twitter cards, canonical links, reciprocal hreflang alternates and
  schema.org JSON-LD typed from each resource's RDF class; emits Highwire Press
  and Dublin Core citation tags plus a Zotero RDF unAPI endpoint so reference
  managers capture correctly typed records; drives a public "How to cite" panel
  with Chicago, APA and MLA renderings and BibTeX, RIS and CSL-JSON downloads;
  and serves a chunked XML sitemap index and robots.txt.
type: software
